The above conjecture is particularly significant for understanding the structure of semi-invariant rings and, hence, the associated quiver moduli spaces in the sense of King. In [19] it was shown that the 22-dimensional weight spaces play an important role in determining the structure of the semi-invariant ring when the maximal GLβ\GL_{ eta}-orbits in repβ⁡(Q)ep_{ eta}(Q) are of codimension 1. We believe that a similar important role will be played by 33-dimensional weight spaces when the maximal GLβ\GL_{ eta}-orbits in repβ⁡(Q)ep_{ eta}(Q) are of codimension 2.

